<section id="S4" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">4. </span>Experiments</h2>

<section id="S4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.1. </span>Datasets and Setup</h3>

<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2. </span>Full results of both long-term and short-term time series forcasting experiments. The lower MSE and MAE indicates a better performance. <span id="S4.T2.10" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Red</span>:the best, <span id="S4.T2.11" class="ltx_text ltx_underline" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">Blue</span><span id="S4.T2.12" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">:</span> the 2th best.</figcaption>
<table id="S4.T2.13" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S4.T2.13.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T2.13.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt" style="padding:-0.75pt 2.4pt;" colspan="2"><span id="S4.T2.13.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Models</span></th>
<td id="S4.T2.13.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding:-0.75pt 2.4pt;" colspan="2"><span id="S4.T2.13.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">MoFE-time</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.13.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding:-0.75pt 2.4pt;" colspan="2"><span id="S4.T2.13.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Time-MoE</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.13.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding:-0.75pt 2.4pt;" colspan="2"><span id="S4.T2.13.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">TimeMixer</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.13.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding:-0.75pt 2.4pt;" colspan="2"><span id="S4.T2.13.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">TimeXer</span></td>
